  "instructions": [
    "In a large stockpot, heat the peanut oil over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped fennel, carrots, and onions, and cook until the vegetables are tender, about 10 minutes.",
    "Add the garlic and cook for 1 minute, until fragrant.",
    "Add the mussels and clams, and cook until they start to open, about 5 minutes.",
    "Pour in the white wine and stir to combine.",
    "Add the lutefisk, chopped into 1-inch pieces, and stir to combine.",
    "Season with furikake, if using.",
    "Bring the broth to a simmer, then reduce the heat to low and cook, covered, for 10-15 minutes, or until the lutefisk is cooked through.",
    "Taste and adjust the seasoning as needed.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with chopped fresh herbs, if desired."
